              "deliverableId": "deliverable:obj_1790046504201_vporlj:launch/page-message",
              "before": "Launch page — messaging review and revised draft\nVersion: 2 (draft for review; not published)\n\nEvidence base\n- Internal launch context (company record: launch/context; observation ev_1790046568153_806r86): the goal is to convert one-person-company founders; the current signal is low signup conversion and visitors do not recognise themselves.\n- Founder narrative pulse (verified acquired input: sim_result_6269e01f64377bbfb5f17971): founders describe switching between selling, researching, followi…",
              "after": "Launch page — messaging review and revised draft\nVersion: 3 (draft for review; not published)\n\nEvidence base\n- Internal launch context (company record: launch/context; observation ev_1790046568153_806r86 and current observation ev_1790046600094_5fa1zo): the goal is to convert one-person-company founders; the current signal is low signup conversion and visitors do not recognise themselves.\n- Existing draft evidence base: founder narrative pulse (verified acquired input previously cited in versio…",
